      <rules>
        <rule name="Weather" id="280e-e29c-6b05-b2d4" hidden="false">
          <description>The Romano-British aren’t affected by the effects of heavy rain.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Romano-British Standard" id="4a69-cf88-34bc-a434" hidden="false">
          <description>Romano-British banners follow the same rules as ordinary banners (see the rulebook, p.79). 


In addition, any enemy figure declaring a charge against a Romano-British figure that is within 6” of a Romano-British banner-bearer takes a -2” penalty to their charge range.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
